OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start to the weekend,
OL,6,Fwith widespread low cloud and hill
OL,7,Ffog. Rain moves in by mid-day and may
OL,8,Fturn heavy at times. Some very strong
OL,9,Fwinds, perhaps reaching gale force
OL,10,Falong the coast and over the Pennines.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMost of the rain and cloud
OL,13,Fclear overnight. Southern parts may
OL,14,Fremain cloudy with showers. Clear
OL,15,Felsewhere allowing temperatures to
OL,16,Fdrop and a frost to form as the wind
OL,17,Feases.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
